{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122787","id":4353441618,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA3w_Ug","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122787","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122787.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122787.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122787","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122787/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122787/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122787/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d0b38f919c7e45b4a29ee443a89bff41d945901f","number":122787,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.cast_motion return type to Vector2","user":{"login":"leelokone","id":171243945,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjT5qQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171243945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone","html_url":"https://github.com/leelokone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leelokone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nOriginal cast_motion returns PackedFloat32Array which creates managed allocations, in C#, this creates a managed array for every call, causing avoidable allocations when the method is repeatedly used during physics processing, this PR target is to solve this with minimun API changes\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the return type to Vector2,  the safe fraction is stored in Vector2.x, and the unsafe fraction is stored in Vector2.y\r\nIf no collision is detected, the method returns Vector2(1.0, 1.0), this preserves the existing no-collision behavior because original method also did return 1.0, 1.0. The change removes the per-call managed allocation caused by the return value.\r\n\r\nThis is a compatibility-breaking API change, existing code must migrate from result[0] and result[1] to result.x and result.y\r\n\r\nThis addresses the first problem described in the proposal. It is a small and independent change from the more comprehensive solution to the second problem, which also removes this allocation.\r\n- Related proposal godotengine/godot-proposals#15430","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-25T00:21:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T08:17:03Z","closed_at":"2026-08-25T08:16:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"95f584b2fbb4ec0a5d1117f76c7aca8e3fe918ee","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"leelokone:physics-cast-motion-vector2","ref":"physics-cast-motion-vector2","repo":{"id":1345477712,"node_id":"R_kgDOUDJcUA","name":"godot","full_name":"leelokone/godot","owner":{"login":"leelokone","id":171243945,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjT5qQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171243945?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.